<title>UK: BP keeps two Brent cargoes from chains - trade.</title>
<headline>BP keeps two Brent cargoes from chains - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>As expected British Petroleum kept both Brent cargoes from Wednesday's chains, trade sources said.</p>
<p>The two cargoes -- due to load in the April 17-19 loading range -- were kept before the five o' clock deadline. BP now holds around 12 cargoes and has kept every cargo, bar one, from the April programme so far.</p>
<p>-- S Hayden London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
